NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000999 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001000 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001001 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001002 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001003 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001004 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001005 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001006 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001007 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001008 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001009 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001010 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001011 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001012 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001013 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001014 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001015 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
